Just occurred to me that La Comodora + Omnitron-X is a more reliable way of pulling off this combo, no need to draw Mental Divergence.&nbsp; You do need to deal with the intervening card, though, which requires a little paying attention to not over- or under-draw (but could be as simple as placing Legacy between La Comodora and Omnitron, or having him go before both and having Team Leader Tachyon in play).
